  <h2 id="hirebeat">Hirebeat internship</h2>
  <p>Software Development Engineer Intern, July to September 2025.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Refactored Google reCAPTCHA v3 into an app-level React provider so registration pages could share token execution.</li>
    <li>Fixed registration confirmation to use the submitted email, added a cancel path, and built reusable account activation layouts.</li>
    <li>Used functional React state updates to prevent notification changes from overwriting one another, and added scroll regions for long notifications.</li>
